  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_st_07-04.txt",
  "sourceHash": "04b52dae612d17da0896c69192b1d7dd4df336b0c3880397d07c49bc329d1d7b",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科西切",
      "text": "我可以把她還給你，魏。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彥吾",
      "text": "——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彥吾",
      "text": "停！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彥吾",
      "text": "......不要動手。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科西切",
      "text": "噢。你這些強大的劊子手，真是讓我吃了很多苦頭。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科西切",
      "text": "我當然可以把她還給你......但她身上的銬環會引爆龍門半數城區。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彥吾",
      "text": "你......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科西切",
      "text": "魏，這是你曾經用來對付我的辦法，是你逼我離開龍門的辦法。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科西切",
      "text": "現在，我們主客易位。我是客人，也是下毒的人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彥吾",
      "text": "科西切。你害死了我的兄弟。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科西切",
      "text": "不，不，魏。是你自己殺了自己的兄弟。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科西切",
      "text": "我的角色並不重要。你兄弟的悲劇，也許出於一匹獨角獸的密令，一條真龍的震怒，但洩露消息的究竟是不是我，不，不重要。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科西切",
      "text": "重要的是，魏，唯一重要的事實是——你用你手中的赤霄劍，殺了自己的兄弟。親手。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科西切",
      "text": "赤霄，斬龍之劍。死在這劍下的是誰？血親，義親，至親。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科西切",
      "text": "斬龍之劍？你們這些人鑄造這把劍，不過用來同類相殘。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彥吾",
      "text": "你說得太多。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科西切",
      "text": "好。我讓你選。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科西切",
      "text": "選吧。殺掉我搶回侄女，並因此毀掉這座城市；又或者允許我們平安離開。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彥吾",
      "text": "——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科西切",
      "text": "不要出劍。你知道後果。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彥吾",
      "text": "（牙齒研磨的聲音）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科西切",
      "text": "放鬆些，魏。我已經允許你選了。如果你不選，那麼我，你，你的市民，還有這一對惹人憐愛的姐妹，都會一起死。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彥吾",
      "text": "你在盤算什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科西切",
      "text": "魏，魏......我瞭解你。我太瞭解你了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科西切",
      "text": "你一直都有得選，不是嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科西切",
      "text": "你寶貴的市民們，一旦聽說他們的生命被放在天平上，而另一邊是一條沒人知道姓名的幼龍，他們會怎麼想？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科西切",
      "text": "而我甚至沒有理由去傷害她。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彥吾",
      "text": "......我既然疏忽到讓你再踏上這座城市，就沒理由再讓你離開。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "小塔！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科西切",
      "text": "真的嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彥吾",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彥吾",
      "text": "我會親手殺了你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科西切",
      "text": "不必，不必。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科西切",
      "text": "我會死在正確的人手上。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科西切",
      "text": "對了，在我給她戴上銬環前，你可以救下她的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科西切",
      "text": "可是你想著防範我，你想著戰勝我，打倒我，毀滅我......想看我要做什麼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科西切",
      "text": "魏，你其實害怕我，不是嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "她來了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "她終於來了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "親手殺了她吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "赦罪師，回答。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "整合運動的領袖，是否有結盟的價值？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師",
      "text": "你很清楚的事情又何必問我，攝政王殿下？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師",
      "text": "一個沒有積累、沒有背景、沒有資本的青年，不可能憑一己之力拿下烏薩斯的重要城市。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師",
      "text": "身為非感染者的統治者們，並不清楚蘊含在她行為裡的邏輯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師",
      "text": "他們會一味恐懼，反應過激，嘗試透過破壞性的行為去解決混亂的局面——感染者帶來的混亂局面。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師",
      "text": "但我們薩卡茲再清楚不過了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "攝政王",
      "text": "至於她留在這裡的隊伍，你的看法是？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師",
      "text": "沒有前景，殿下，正如你預見的那樣，並沒有什麼前景。他們並不是真正的軍隊，而我們需要的是足夠的暴力。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "攝政王",
      "text": "剪除他們不能削弱塔露拉的力量。我們缺少一個消滅她的機會。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師",
      "text": "是的，殿下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師",
      "text": "她所帶來的局面、她攪動局面所需要的力量，都恰恰說明她並不是一個單純的感染者領袖，或是做好了準備去繼承皇冠的王儲。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師",
      "text": "她是個陰謀家。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "攝政王",
      "text": "即使如此，我也需要薩卡茲的全面回應。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師",
      "text": "那麼，我有兩個好消息，第一是，對於“魔王”的搜查，已經有眉目了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師",
      "text": "羅德島從未易手過。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "攝政王",
      "text": "來不及。我們必須立刻讓她開始。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師",
      "text": "請不要發怒，允許我說出第二個吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師",
      "text": "“她”已經準備好了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "攝政王",
      "text": "這才是我們應有的力量。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "攝政王",
      "text": "薩卡茲的正統王者，比任何不知名姓的繼承人都強。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
